==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns as the boss after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using the [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]] [[Cat Combo|Combo]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can easily complete this level.

Using [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] at level 19 or above can also clear the first two enemies easily, giving you enough money for your Bahamut/other units you might have.

